# This file keeps the output/ directory present in fresh clones.
# The Agent projects build ObscurizeAgent32.dll / ObscurizeAgent64.dll here,
# and ObscurizeService.rc embeds them as RCDATA. The DLLs are generated build
# outputs and are intentionally NOT tracked (see .gitignore) so the service EXE
# only ever embeds freshly-compiled, source-matching payload bytes.
